{"version": 2, "width": 84, "height": 30, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "python"}}
["o", 0.9, "\u001b[1m\u001b[97m$ python demo.py\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 1.02, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 1.47, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 1.59, " 1. QUESTION - one sentence, metric named, cost estimated\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 2.04, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 2.16, "Does builtin sum() beat a manual for-loop on median full-pass time over\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 2.56, "\u001b[97midentical integer lists? Metric: median pass seconds. Cost: ~24 runs, seconds.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 2.68, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 3.13, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 3.25, " 2. PILOT - calibration only: 'how do I run it', never 'does X work'\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 3.7, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 4.1, "\u001b[97m3 untimed calibration passes -> noise floor 11.2% of median pass\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 4.22, "(sets operational expectations; no hypothesis is tested here)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 4.34, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 4.79, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 4.91, " 3. REGISTRY - DECISIONS.md opened before anything else, rows at decision time\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.36, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.48, "appended: | D-001 | 2026-11-21 02:27 UTC | Demo design: builtin vs manual loop,\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.6, "    paired repeats | same interpreter, same lists |\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.72, "appended: | D-002 | 2026-11-21 02:27 UTC | Threshold 10%: below it, the switch is\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.84, "    not worth a diff review | practical-significance argument, pre-data |\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 5.96, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 6.41, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 6.53, " 4. PREREGISTER - hypotheses, thresholds, analysis plan -> frozen + sha256\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 6.98, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 7.1, "written; nothing confirmatory has been measured yet\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 7.22, "original: ~/demo/PREREGISTRATION.md\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 7.57, "\u001b[38;5;114msha256:   324f7b3128aaa33da8e1f429e40156f02b1719b11968e1d03700b24673e28dfc\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 7.69, "frozen:   ~/demo/docs/PREREGISTRATION_frozen.md\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 8.04, "\u001b[38;5;114msha256:   324f7b3128aaa33da8e1f429e40156f02b1719b11968e1d03700b24673e28dfc\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 8.16, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 8.61, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 8.73, " 5. RUN - 12 paired repeats, shuffled arm order, raw records only\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 9.18, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 9.3, "24 raw records -> raw_runs.jsonl (one record per run, not a summary)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 9.6, "\u001b[38;5;114mcorrectness gate: builtin sum == loop sum == reference on every pass: True\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 9.72, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 10.17, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 10.29, " 6. ANALYZE - only the preregistered test, effect + p\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 10.74, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 11.14, "\u001b[97mmedian pass: builtin 0.51 ms vs loop 3.57 ms\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 11.54, "\u001b[97mrelative reduction R = 85.7%   (frozen threshold: >= 10%)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 11.94, "\u001b[97mexact two-sided sign-flip p = 0.000488   (frozen alpha: 0.05)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 12.06, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 12.51, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 12.63, " 7. VERDICT - looked up from the frozen rule, not argued\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 13.08, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 13.78, "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;114mrule: ADOPT builtin if R >= 0.10 AND p < 0.05, else KEEP loop\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 14.48, "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;114mfired: ADOPT builtin  (R = 85.7%, p = 0.000488)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 14.6, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 15.05, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 15.17, " 8. REPORT - manifest, deviations... and the guards refuse to rewrite history\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 15.62, "\u001b[38;5;243m================================================================\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 15.74, "4 files -> ~/demo/docs/manifest.sha256\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 16.09, "\u001b[38;5;114mmanifest sha256: c70a7479dca654c5060d7a6a194b78c61a6b1ad89076f7549f645060e4b027b6\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 16.21, "Deviations: none found - demo, but the section would be here anyway.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 16.81, "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;203mre-freeze exit 1:\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 17.06, "\u001b[38;5;203m  freeze: ~/demo/docs/PREREGISTRATION_frozen.md already exists. Do NOT overwrite -\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 17.31, "\u001b[38;5;203m    the change protocol is append-only addenda ('changed after start, reason').\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 17.91, "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;203mmanifest overwrite exit 1:\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 18.16, "\u001b[38;5;203m  manifest: ~/demo/docs/manifest.sha256 exists. Manifests are immutable - write a\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 18.41, "\u001b[38;5;203m    new one for the new state instead.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 18.53, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 19.33, "\u001b[1m\u001b[97mImmutable by default. That is the whole point.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 19.45, "\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 19.57, "(temp dir removed - your disk is clean)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
["o", 20.37, "\u001b[1m\u001b[97mNow imagine the agent doing this before every benchmark it runs for you.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
